{"id": "msg_da060baa00d64a42bf81c25c5cc6b651", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_F9ZPtkxEwO6S73L0207F5029", "tool_name": "read", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<path>C:\\\\Program Files\\\\Python310\\\\Lib\\\\site-packages\\\\cnequity\\\\steps\\\\bars.py</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n76: def _reject_unfinished_daily_bar_window(\\n77:     config: Config,\\n78:     end: date,\\n79:     *,\\n80:     now: datetime | None = None,\\n81: ) -> None:\\n82:     \\\"\\\"\\\"Reject a window whose newest daily bar is still forming in Shanghai.\\n83: \\n84:     TDX ``start=0`` includes the current daily K. Once trading begins that row\\n85:     has plausible OHLC and non-zero volume, so content checks cannot distinguish\\n86:     it from a settled bar. Refuse the fetch before any symbol batch starts: a\\n87:     market-wide sweep that crosses 15:00 would otherwise mix partial and final\\n88:     bars in one curated partition.\\n89: \\n90:     Historical windows and non-trading days are unaffected. ``now`` is\\n91:     injectable so the timezone boundary is deterministic in tests.\\n92:     \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n93:     local_now = shanghai_now(now)\\n94:     today = local_now.date()\\n95:     if end < today or local_now.time() >= _DAILY_BAR_FINAL_AT:\\n96:         return\\n97:     if not is_trading_day(config, today):\\n98:         return\\n99:     raise RuntimeError(\\n100:         f\\\"daily_bars {end}: the current A-share session is not final until \\\"\\n101:         f\\\"{_DAILY_BAR_FINAL_AT.strftime('%H:%M')} Asia/Shanghai \\\"\\n102:         f\\\"(now {local_now.strftime('%H:%M:%S')}); refusing to stage an \\\"\\n103:         \\\"in-progress daily bar. Re-run after the cutoff.\\\"\\n104:     )\\n105: \\n106: \\n107: def _last_final_session(now: datetime | None = None) -> date:\\n108:     \\\"\\\"\\\"The newest date whose daily bar has settled.\\n109: \\n110:     The mirror of :func:`_reject_unfinished_daily_bar_window`: what that refuses\\n111:     to fetch, this is what a history sweep should ask for instead.\\n112: \\n113:     Deliberately clock-only. Asking the calendar whether today trades would\\n114:     make a window depend on a `trading_calendar` the lake may not have yet —\\n115:     `cne init` builds it one phase before the first backfill — and it buys\\n116:     nothing: stepping back a day on a Sunday lands on Saturday, and a window\\n117:     ending on a day with no session loses none of the sessions before it.\\n118:     \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n119:     local_now = shanghai_now(now)\\n120:     if local_now.time() >= _DAILY_BAR_FINAL_AT:\\n121:         return local_now.date()\\n122:     return local_now.date() - timedelta(days=1)\\n123: \\n124: \\n125: def _backfill_window(config: Config, trade_date: date) -> tuple[date, date]:\\n126:     \\\"\\\"\\\"``--start/--end`` window for a backfill, defaulting to the full history.\\n127: \\n128:     Repairing a single bad session must not mean re-fetching a decade for every\\n129:     symbol. A capture that fires before the close writes a truncated bar — right\\n130:     open, wrong close, partial volume — and the repair is one day wide.\\n\\n(Showing lines 76-130 of 5776. Use offset=131 to continue.)\\n</content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_da060baa00d64a42bf81c25c5cc6b651", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 2961, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-05T01:52:40.785Z"}
{"id": "msg_4c2a85b10cb84744871838a47e1531ed", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "逻辑确认：`end`(11-05) >= today(11-05) 且现在 <15:05 且今天是交易日 → 抛错拒绝。它拒绝的是**以今天为 end 的整个窗口**（不是只跳当日）。所以只要在 15:05 前跑，daily_bars 一律失败，10-30~11-04 也不会补。\n\n这意味着：**必须在今天 15:05 收盘后才能完成行情更新到最新**。在此之前无法拿到最新行情。\n\n现在给用户一个清晰的状态与选择。核心结论：\n- 数据更新已推进：事件流(公告/新闻/监管)✅、财务✅、外部银行/实控人✅ 都更新到 11-05；\n- 行情 daily_bars 因**盘中保护**（15:05前）无法入库，仍停在 10-29；\n- 筛选结果若要基于最新行情，必须等收盘后重跑行情，再重拉筛选。\n\n我先确认：现有 10-29 数据能否先跑出一版筛选结果（用户要\"重新拉取筛选结果\"）。先探一下筛选脚本能否在缺 10-30~11-04 行情时运行（它会用 pick_base 取最近完整交易日=10-29）。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_Mn1ShjqhYAYZQbjoC6Ew5726", "tool_name": "pwsh", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"command": "Write-Output \"== pick_base 实现 ==\"; Get-Content '分析产出\\lake_base.py'\nWrite-Output \"== 15:05 cutoff 常量 ==\"; Select-String -Path 'C:\\Program Files\\Python310\\lib\\site-packages\\cnequity\\steps\\bars.py' -Pattern '_DAILY_BAR_FINAL_AT\\s*=' | ForEach-Object {$_.Line.Trim()}", "description": "Inspect pick_base and cutoff constant", "workdir": "D:\\repository\\数据湖"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-05T01:52:45.120Z"}
{"id": "msg_6c9101ac3b004085a7ede5e1514c3b21", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_00_Mn1ShjqhYAYZQbjoC6Ew5726", "tool_name": "pwsh", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"== pick_base 实现 ==\\r\\n# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\\r\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"鏁版嵁婀栧熀鍑嗘棩閫夋嫨锛氬敮涓€瀹炵幇銆?\\r\\n\\r\\n鏁版嵁婀栫殑 max(trade_date) 涓嶄繚璇佹槸瀹屾暣浜ゆ槗鏃ャ€?026-10-16 鏄竴娆＄湡瀹炴渚嬶細\\r\\n璇ユ棩鍏ㄥ競鍦哄钩鍧囨垚浜ら 863.8 涓囷紝浠呬负姝ゅ墠 20 鏃ヤ腑浣嶆暟锛?,913 涓囷級鐨?45%锛?\\r\\n绮ら珮閫烝 鍗曞彧鎴愪氦閲?3.63 涓囨墜锛堝钩鏃?1,379 涓囨墜锛夛紝鏀剁洏浠峰嵈璺虫定 7.1%銆?\\r\\n杩欐槸鐩樹腑/娈嬬己蹇収琚啓搴擄紝涓嶆槸琛屾儏銆?\\r\\n\\r\\n鑻ユ嬁瀹冨綋鍩哄噯鏃ワ紝浼氬悓鏃舵薄鏌撲笁涓彛寰勶紝鑰屼笖閿欏緱銆岀湅璧锋潵寰堜繚瀹堛€嶏紝涓嶄細鏈変汉鎬€鐤戯細\\r\\n  路 娉㈠姩鐜囷細绮ら珮閫烝 23.50% 鈫?24.51%锛堝浜嗕竴涓亣鐨?7% 璺崇┖锛?\\r\\n  路 鑲℃伅鐜囷細4.45% 鈫?4.15%锛堝垎姣嶇敤浜嗛敊鐨勪环锛?\\r\\n  路 鍥炴挙锛氬亣璺虫定杩涘叆鍑€鍊煎簭鍒楋紝鏈€澶у洖鎾よ鍓婂钩\\r\\n\\r\\n鍒ゆ嵁鐢ㄦ垚浜ら鑰岄潪浜ゆ槗鏃ュ巻锛氭棩鍘嗗彧鐭ラ亾鍝ぉ寮€甯傦紝涓嶇煡閬撴暟鎹槸鍚︽敹鍏ㄣ€?\\r\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\r\\nimport pandas as pd\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\ndef pick_base(con, ratio=0.80, lookback=20, verbose=True, table='src.daily_bars'):\\r\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"杩斿洖鏈€杩戜竴涓€屾垚浜ら杈炬爣銆嶇殑浜ゆ槗鏃ワ紙str锛夈€?\\r\\n\\r\\n    鏌愭棩鍏ㄥ競鍦哄钩鍧囦釜鑲℃垚浜ら浣庝簬鍓?lookback 鏃ヤ腑浣嶆暟鐨?ratio 鍊嶏紝鍒や负涓嶅畬鏁达紝\\r\\n    缁х画鍥為€€銆傛病鏈変袱澶╄繛缁畫缂虹殑姝ｅ父鎯呭喌涓嬶紝閫€涓€澶╁氨澶熴€?\\r\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"\\r\\n    days = con.execute(f\\\"\\\"\\\"\\r\\n        select trade_date, avg(amount) amt from {table}\\r\\n        where amount is not null and amount > 0\\r\\n        group by 1 order by 1 desc limit ?\\r\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\", [lookback + 5]).df()\\r\\n    if not len(days):\\r\\n        raise RuntimeError('鏁版嵁婀栨棤鍙敤浜ゆ槗鏃?)\\r\\n    days = days.sort_values('trade_date').reset_index(drop=True)\\r\\n    for i in range(len(days) - 1, 0, -1):\\r\\n        full = days.amt.iloc[max(0, i - lookback):i]\\r\\n        med = float(full.median())\\r\\n        if med > 0 and days.amt.iloc[i] >= ratio * med:\\r\\n            if i < len(days) - 1 and verbose:\\r\\n                print(f'[鍩哄噯鏃ユ牎姝 {str(days.trade_date.iloc[-1])[:10]} 鍏ㄥ競鍦轰釜鑲″钩鍧囨垚浜ら '\\r\\n                      f'浠呬负鍓?{len(full)} 鏃ヤ腑浣嶆暟 {med/1e4:.0f} 涓囩殑 '\\r\\n                      f'{days.amt.iloc[i]/med*100:.0f}%锛屽垽涓轰笉瀹屾暣蹇収锛?\\r\\n                      f'鍩哄噯鏃ュ洖閫€鑷?{str(days.trade_date.iloc[i])[:10]}')\\r\\n            return str(days.trade_date.iloc[i])\\r\\n    return str(days.trade_date.iloc[-1])\\r\\n== 15:05 cutoff 常量 ==\\r\\n_DAILY_BAR_FINAL_AT = A_SHARE_FINAL_AT\\r\\n\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_6c9101ac3b004085a7ede5e1514c3b21", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 1984, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-05T01:52:45.364Z"}
